! Declares the DPI every other app already assumes. Unset, winit reads the
! panel's real EDID size (~142 DPI on this 14" 1080p) and scales alacritty to
! 1.5x while polybar, dunst and GTK stay at 96. Merged at login by i3, which is
! why it lives here rather than in the theme templates -- those are rendered
! only when theme.sh is run by hand.
Xft.dpi: 96

Xft.antialias: 1
Xft.hinting:   1
Xft.hintstyle: hintslight
Xft.rgba:      rgb
Xft.lcdfilter: lcddefault
